        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>优质猫粮怎么选</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fdece4;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdece4;\n    padding: 10px 0 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #111;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin: 8px 0 14px;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .title span {\n    background: #ffe94a;\n    padding: 2px 8px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n  }\n  .card {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    margin: 0 14px 14px;\n    padding: 14px 16px 18px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .sec-head {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 23px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #111;\n    background: #ffe9b0;\n    padding: 2px 8px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .row {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 6px 0;\n  }\n  .row b { font-weight: 900; }\n  .mark {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .ok { color: #17a34a; font-weight: 900; }\n  .no { color: #e8442c; font-weight: 900; }\n  .sub-head {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #e8442c;\n    margin: 12px 0 4px;\n  }\n  .label-red {\n    color: #e8442c;\n    font-weight: 900;\n  }\n  .strong-red { color: #e8442c; font-weight: 900; }\n  .para {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #d9b6a8;\n    color: #b08b7c;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n  }\n  .ph-cloud {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 8px;\n    bottom: 10px;\n    width: 110px;\n    height: 100px;\n  }\n  .ph-cats {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 14px;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    width: 175px;\n    height: 60px;\n  }\n  .grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin: 0 14px;\n  }\n  .mini {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 12px 12px 14px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .mini h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .mini p {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #e8442c;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .mini h3 .hl { background: #ffe94a; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 2px; }\n  .gap { height: 12px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title\"><span>优质猫粮怎么选</span></div>\n\n  <!-- Section 1 -->\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">1.看猫粮配料表</div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <span class=\"mark ok\">✅</span><span class=\"label-red\">配料表肉类排名：</span><b>鲜肉&gt;肉粉&gt;肉副产品</b>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <span class=\"mark ok\">✅</span><span class=\"label-red\">肉源种类排名：</span><b>鸡肉&gt;鸭肉&gt;兔肉&gt;鹌鹑肉&gt;牛羊猪肉&gt;鱼肉，</b><br>\n      以鸡肉为主，猫咪接受度高，适口性好\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sub-head\">避开以下成分</div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <span class=\"mark no\">❌</span><span class=\"label-red\">不良诱食剂:</span>肉味香精调味剂风味添加剂、口味增强剂等\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <span class=\"mark no\">❌</span><span class=\"label-red\">不良防腐剂：</span>BHA/BHT\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <span class=\"mark no\">❌</span><span class=\"label-red\">糖分:</span>玉米糖浆、蔗糖、山梨醇等\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder ph-cloud\">[插图：云朵猫脸卡通，右下角]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Section 2 -->\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">2.看营养保证值</div>\n    <div class=\"para\">\n      猫粮成分保证值需要满足AAFCO标准，高蛋白中脂肪低碳水满<br>\n      足猫咪的日常营养需求\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder ph-cats\">[插图：四只猫咪排排坐，右下角]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Grid row 1 -->\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"mini\">\n      <h3><span class=\"hl\">粗蛋白35%+</span></h3>\n      <p>作为主要的能量来源，含量越多越好</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mini\">\n      <h3><span class=\"hl\">粗脂肪15%+</span></h3>\n      <p>脂肪适中即可，太高太低都不好</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mini\">\n      <h3><span class=\"hl\">粗灰分10%-</span></h3>\n      <p>越低越好，决定肉类原料品质</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"gap\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Grid row 2 -->\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"mini\">\n      <h3><span class=\"hl\">淀粉20%-</span></h3>\n      <p>越低越好，猫不吸收淀粉</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mini\">\n      <h3><span class=\"hl\">钙磷比1:0.8</span></h3>\n      <p>钙磷比决定猫咪的生长发育</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mini\">\n      <h3><span class=\"hl\">牛磺酸0.2%+</span></h3>\n      <p>对猫咪至关重要但自身无法合成</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
